WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.270
Drop a ball.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.130
It falls down.

3
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.210
Always down.

4
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.170
But what is pulling it?

5
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.970
Now imagine you pack a ten kilogram
bag and fly it all the way

6
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.230
to the Moon.

7
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.510
When you land, is the
bag still ten kilograms?

8
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.870
Does it weigh the same
as it did on Earth?

9
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.070
Or does it weigh nothing at all?

10
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.190
In this mission, you'll
find out what gravity is,

11
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.910
and what mass and weight each mean.

12
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.590
Then you'll use one short equation
to work out weight on other

13
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.670
worlds.

14
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:33.710
Your mission: decide if you would
really be lighter on the Moon.
